{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Infected Escaped",
    "steam_appid": 3441550,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trapped on an island overrun by infected creatures, survivors must work together to stay alive in a hostile environment:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge essential supplies such as food, medicine, armor, gas masks, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight off increasingly powerful infected enemies\u2014their numbers and strength grow as the toxic fog spreads.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some traps and defensive items can be found on the map, and players can use them to block the infected's attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The map periodically reveals new \u201cflipped\u201d areas, encouraging constant exploration until the entire island is uncovered.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the final phase of survival, players\u2019 weapons will be automatically replaced with high-damage versions to face tougher threats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect shards throughout the game to upgrade your weapons and enhance your combat effectiveness.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Development Status</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is currently in Early Access. Content is still under development, and more features and updates will be added over time.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trapped on an island overrun by infected creatures, survivors must work together to stay alive in a hostile environment:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge essential supplies such as food, medicine, armor, gas masks, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight off increasingly powerful infected enemies\u2014their numbers and strength grow as the toxic fog spreads.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some traps and defensive items can be found on the map, and players can use them to block the infected's attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The map periodically reveals new \u201cflipped\u201d areas, encouraging constant exploration until the entire island is uncovered.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the final phase of survival, players\u2019 weapons will be automatically replaced with high-damage versions to face tougher threats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect shards throughout the game to upgrade your weapons and enhance your combat effectiveness.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Development Status</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is currently in Early Access. Content is still under development, and more features and updates will be added over time.</p>",
    "short_description": "A co-op PvE survival game where you team up with other survivors to scavenge resources, fight infected enemies, uncover the map, and reach the final extraction point.",
